  "bodyHash": "fVPr0KC3I+c=",
  "content": "<p>本模组在平原地区添加了一座<strong>灾厄哨塔</strong>，其中满载战利品与珍贵物资。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>生成机制：</strong>该<strong>哨塔</strong>会出现在<strong>平原生物群系</strong>中。</li>\n<li><strong>灾厄村民：</strong>哨塔由多种灾厄村民驻守。</li>\n<li>卫道士会守护战利品，同时您还能发现隐藏的宝藏。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/153/310/172/illager-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/151/310/172/illager-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/157/310/172/illager-cover.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"165\"></p><p>欢迎在您的整合包中自由使用本模组</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1136/149/310/172/illager-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"164\"></p><p>本模组由以下合作者共同制作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fmrminetex%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrMinetex</a></p>\n\n（说明：根据Minecraft中文社区规范，\"Illager\"统一译为\"灾厄村民\"，\"Fortress\"结合上下文译为\"哨塔\"更符合游戏内建筑特征，保留原超链接结构与图片尺寸参数，合作者名称按惯例保留英文ID）",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
